Spec: Actual Agent control authority integration

Purpose:
  Verify independent .NET and Java clients over actual mTLS HTTP against current durable server authority.

Owns:
  ./verify.ps1
  ./README.md

Structure:
  ./dotnet: Owned fixture lifecycle, .NET control verification and evidence.
  ./java: Independent platform-key Java control receiver.

Must:
  Generate each client private key only in its own process and share only public CSRs and certificates.
  Isolate loopback endpoints and protected ignored fixtures without installing or altering running components.
  Verify exact-scope acquisition, independent publisher validation, revoked permissions, wrong pins, closed generations and cancellation.
  Exercise actual SDK and Java peer business bytes with both local and server grants; verify signed authority revocation interrupts blocked data within five seconds.
  Keep both actual data channels alive for sixty-five real seconds and verify new server-issued, publisher-validated lease renewals without backend redial.
